&lt;h2&gt;Stop repeated host key prompts for a server&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A server you chose not to be asked about no longer prompts again when its host key changes. The tab shows when a changed key was accepted.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Host key prompts&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Check Don’t ask again for this server, even if its key changes, and PromeFTP accepts that server&amp;#x27;s changed key without asking again.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changed keys&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Without that checkbox, PromeFTP still asks you to verify a changed key.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class="notice"&gt;Close active sessions before updating. Requires macOS 13 or later on Apple Silicon. Check the host key option only for a server you trust.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/PROMLEE/promeftp/releases/tag/v1.1.17"&gt;Read the full release notes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
